{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00019",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 3.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Afternoon. Take the chair by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 4.6,
      "end_seconds": 7.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.42,
      "end_seconds": 10.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.33,
      "end_seconds": 14.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Only about ten minutes, no trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.67,
      "end_seconds": 16.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "In your own words, what's happened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.3,
      "end_seconds": 28.82,
      "duration_seconds": 11.52,
      "text": "Mainly I've been putting on weight over the last year. That's why I came. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.46,
      "end_seconds": 31.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Alright, when did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.97,
      "end_seconds": 41.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Yeah, it's been about three months now. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.65,
      "end_seconds": 47.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.19,
      "end_seconds": 62.8,
      "duration_seconds": 14.61,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get sore knees as well. So, with sore knees, about a eight out of ten. It just comes and goes. I'd been feeling sleepy in the day, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.89,
      "end_seconds": 67.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.09,
      "end_seconds": 68.79,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.91,
      "end_seconds": 87.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any increased thirst, low mood or palpitations at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.57,
      "end_seconds": 90.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.29,
      "end_seconds": 96.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain or irregular periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.86,
      "end_seconds": 100.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Nothing like that, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.61,
      "end_seconds": 104.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.53,
      "end_seconds": 108.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Oh, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.84,
      "end_seconds": 111.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.92,
      "end_seconds": 129.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Okay, that's done."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 130.47,
      "end_seconds": 141.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse is 78 beats a minute, BMI works out to 36.3, weight 85 kilos, height 153 centimetres, respiratory rate 16, pressure 124 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.55,
      "end_seconds": 146.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.69,
      "end_seconds": 152.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.47,
      "end_seconds": 155.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.62,
      "end_seconds": 161.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 163.92,
      "end_seconds": 168.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 250 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.99,
      "end_seconds": 172.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.25,
      "end_seconds": 188.46,
      "duration_seconds": 15.21,
      "text": "So, not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day. I took the morning off to come in today. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.87,
      "end_seconds": 189.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.31,
      "end_seconds": 194.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Um, I'm on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.8,
      "end_seconds": 209.74,
      "duration_seconds": 13.94,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.84,
      "end_seconds": 212.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.1,
      "end_seconds": 215.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.46,
      "end_seconds": 219.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bypass operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.93,
      "end_seconds": 225.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "So, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.67,
      "end_seconds": 228.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.69,
      "end_seconds": 233.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.02,
      "end_seconds": 235.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "I have diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.62,
      "end_seconds": 236.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.92,
      "end_seconds": 240.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.95,
      "end_seconds": 241.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.41,
      "end_seconds": 249.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "I've had heart disease, yes. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.9,
      "end_seconds": 263.78,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "Right. Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today. Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.64,
      "end_seconds": 277.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "Yes, uh, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.12,
      "end_seconds": 280.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.94,
      "end_seconds": 283.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.11,
      "end_seconds": 287.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.77,
      "end_seconds": 302.42,
      "duration_seconds": 13.65,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.55,
      "end_seconds": 307.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.99,
      "end_seconds": 311.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.42,
      "end_seconds": 322.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Your waist measures about a hundred and four centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.96,
      "end_seconds": 336.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.77,
      "end_seconds": 341.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.29,
      "end_seconds": 342.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.42,
      "end_seconds": 364.51,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking. I can't rule out an underactive thyroid yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.84,
      "end_seconds": 367.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.78,
      "end_seconds": 388.78,
      "duration_seconds": 20.0,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been putting on weight over the last year for about three months, and no palpitations or irregular periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.32,
      "end_seconds": 393.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I mean, exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.8,
      "end_seconds": 409.55,
      "duration_seconds": 14.75,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for weight gain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. We should do a lipid profile for metabolic risk. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.21,
      "end_seconds": 412.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.07,
      "end_seconds": 440.82,
      "duration_seconds": 24.75,
      "text": "I'm going to order an HbA1c, for weight gain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Start with small, specific changes: smaller portions, no sugary drinks, a thirty-minute walk most days. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'll also refer you to a dietitian."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 442.3,
      "end_seconds": 443.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.67,
      "end_seconds": 452.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 455.39,
      "end_seconds": 456.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.69,
      "end_seconds": 465.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 466.37,
      "end_seconds": 470.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 471.43,
      "end_seconds": 476.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 477.37,
      "end_seconds": 483.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 484.32,
      "end_seconds": 486.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 487.83,
      "end_seconds": 489.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}